      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the connection you've drawn to quantum phenomena is deeply interesting, currently, there is no established scientific mechanism linking low-level particle exposure to the conscious visualization of probabilistic wave function shifts. What you are describing aligns more closely with pareidolia or a highly specific form of synesthesia, where subconscious patterns are overlaid onto reality. Given your consistency, a specialist in neuro-optics or cognitive science might offer a more focused perspective on how your brain is processing these external cues.",
